ase.","f":["<strong>","</strong>","<a href=\"https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues\">","</a>"]},{"s":35723,"e":35745,"k":"text","t":"Collect the key facts:","f":[]},{"s":35763,"e":35859,"k":"block","t":"The korTTY version — shown in KTPH000Help KTPH002 AboutKTPH001 and in the footer of this manual.","f":["<strong>","</strong>","&gt;"]},{"s":35869,"e":35945,"k":"block","t":"Your operating system and version (e.g. macOS 15, Windows 11, Ubuntu 24.04).","f":[]},{"s":35955,"e":36038,"k":"block","t":"Exact steps to reproduce the problem, what you expected, and what happened instead.","f":[]},{"s":36048,"e":36249,"k":"block","t":"A relevant excerpt from the application log KTPH000 (see KTPH001Configuration filesKTPH002) and, for crashes, any crash report your OS produced.","f":["<code>~/.kortty/kortty.log</code>","<a href=\"../reference/config-files.html\">","</a>"]},{"s":36259,"e":36297,"k":"block","t":"A screenshot if the problem is visual.","f":[]},{"s":36319,"e":36626,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Open the issueKTPH001 at KTPH002https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/newKTPH003: use a short, specific title (e.g. KTPH004\"SFTP tab freezes when renaming a file on Windows 11\"KTPH005), paste the collected facts into the description, and submit it.","f":["<strong>","</strong>","<a href=\"https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/new\">","</a>","<em>","</em>"]},{"s":36636,"e":36750,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Stay reachableKTPH001 — follow-up questions on the issue are common; enable GitHub notifications for it.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":36823,"e":36836,"k":"block","t":"Data Security","f":[]},{"s":36844,"e":37030,"k":"block","t":"Log files and screenshots can contain sensitive information such as hostnames, usernames, file paths or session details. Review and redact everything you attach to a public GitHub issue.","f":[]},{"s":37077,"e":37191,"k":"block","t":"Suggest a feature or ideaKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#suggest-a-feature-or-idea\" tit